    JET HUB - BETA
    Record / Play macro hub with exact-cash system
    - Cash is read from the real numeric value (leaderstats / attribute / value object)
    - Cost of every place / upgrade is measured from the real cash drop
    - Playback waits for the exact amount, verifies each purchase, and re-learns costs
    v2 changes:
    - Recorder hook no longer yields / clobbers the namecall method (fixes "can't place while recording")
    - Fishing: pick the cast spot once (cast in-game), Auto Fish reuses it
    - Macro tab: live step status while playing (วางตัว(...) / รอเงิน(...))
    - Auto cost correction: +1 fast retry when the learned cost is too low, fixed value written back to the macro
]]

